# A secret's page on the desktop (sfdesk vault_item.mbt, the web's cloud/VaultItem.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the
# made-up chat. ⌘, then 密钥, down to its secrets, the first.
timeout 30000
until 按空格输入
wait 600
key cmd+,
wait 1000
tap 密钥
wait 1500
move 800 500
wheel 900
wait 900
tap GitHub token
wait 1800
exit
